Package: Rcausality
Type: Package
Title: Causality Analysis for Time Series
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zsolt Tibor", "Kosztyán", email = "kzst@gtk.uni-pannon.hu",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")))
Description: A unified interface to causality detection methods for time
    series: Granger causality and its Bayesian (Bayes factor) variant, and
    - in forthcoming releases - the Markov-chain, conditional-mutual-
    information, dimensional, entropy-based and partial-information-
    decomposition approaches. Works with two series, a data frame
    (all pairs) or two blocks of series (MIMO), and returns a rich
    'causres' object with 'print', 'summary' and 'plot' methods.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: stats, graphics, grDevices
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown, lmtest
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
